//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palia","i":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/coc1y2.jpg","s":"Palia is a free-to-play life simulation MMO where players take on the role of humans who have mysteriously appeared in a world primarily inhabited by a species called the Majiri. Gameplay centers on village life activities including fishing, foraging, hunting, mining, insect catching, cooking, furniture making, gardening, and ranching. Players work to become members of Kilima Village by gathering and crafting materials, with the adjacent Bahari Bay area offering higher-level resources and server-wide events."},{"t":"Pand Land","p":["iOS","Android"],"d":"Game Freak , WonderPlanet","u":"WonderPlanet","g":"RPG","r":"June 24"},{"t":"Paper Ghost Stories: Third Eye Open","p":["Windows","Nintendo Switch","PlayStation 5","Xbox Series X/S"],"d":"Cellar Vault Games","u":"Chorus Worldwide","g":"Adventure","r":"September 5"},{"t":"Paper Lily: Chapter 1","p":["Linux","macOS","Windows"],"d":"Leef 6010","u":"Leef 6010","g":"Puzzle, Role-playing (RPG), Adventure, Indie","r":"January 26, 2024","l":"https://www.igdb.com/games/paper-lily-chapter-1","i":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co756b.jpg","s":"Something terrible has happened. You can’t bear to think about it - but you can’t live like this anymore. You stopped attending school, you haven’t left your house in months, you have no reason to get out of bed anymore. There are no choices left.\n\nNo choice except... that strange golden letter.\n\nIt’s time to get your life back together.\n\nOne last try."},{"t":"Paper Mario: The Thousand-Year Door","p":["Nintendo Switch"],"d":"Intelligent Systems","u":"Nintendo","g":"RPG","r":"May 23","l":"https://www.igdb.com/games/paper-mario-the-thousand-year-door--1","i":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/cob9xy.jpg","s":"A remake of the second game in the Paper Mario series, originally released for the Nintendo GameCube.\n\nTurn the page and join Mario and friends in an RPG adventure to discover the legendary treasure behind the ancient Thousand-Year Door. Will Mario complete his papery quest, or will he crumple under the pressure?"},{"t":"Paper Perjury","p":["Windows"],"d":"Paper Cat Games","u":"Paper Cat Games","g":"Adventure, Visual novel","r":"December 9"},{"t":"Paper Trail","p":["Windows","Nintendo Switch","PlayStation 4","PlayStation 5","Xbox One","Xbox Series X/S","iOS","Android"],"d":"Newfangled Games","u":"Newfangled Games","g":"Adventure, Puzzle","r":"May 21","l":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paper_Trail_(video_game)"},{"t":"Parasol Stars","p":["Nintendo Switch","PlayStation 4","PlayStation 5","Xbox One","Xbox Series X/S"],"d":"Taito","u":"ININ Games","g":"Platformer","r":"July 11","l":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Parasol_Stars"},{"t":"Parcel Corps","p":["Windows","PlayStation 5","Xbox Series X/S"],"d":"Billy Goat Entertainment","u":"Secret Mode","g":"Action-adventure","r":"October 3"},{"t":"Parking Garage Rally Circuit","p":["Windows"],"d":"Walaber Entertainment","u":"Walaber Entertainment","g":"Racing","r":"September 20"},{"t":"Path of Exile 2","p":["macOS","Xbox Series X/S","Windows","PlayStation 5"],"d":"Grinding Gear Games","u":"Grinding Gear Games, Kakao Games","g":"Role-playing (RPG), Hack and slash/Beat 'em up, Adventure","r":"December 6, 2024","l":"https://www.igdb.com/games/path-of-exile-2","i":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co8ae0.jpg","s":"Path of Exile 2 is a next generation Action RPG created by Grinding Gear Games. Set years after the original Path of Exile, you will return to the dark world of Wraeclast and seek to end the corruption that is spreading. Path of Exile 2 is a free-to-play online multiplayer game with co-op for up to six players."},{"t":"Path of Mystery: A Brush with Death","p":["Nintendo Switch"],"g":"Adventure, Visual Novel","l":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Path_of_Mystery:_A_Brush_with_Death","i":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/cobc90.jpg","s":"A completely new title from Imagineer and Toybox Inc., Mystery Walk is the first in a three-part serial drama series!\n\nThe game is set in Narumisawa, a charming, fictional summer getaway town that feels familiar, as though you have seen it somewhere before…\n\nThe story alternates between the present and the past to uncover the truth behind an unsolved case from 30 years ago.\n\nTold through a prologue, 10 episodes, and a mysterious “?” episode, the mysteries deepen with each chapter.\n\nThe fully voiced dialogue, brought to life by a talented cast, will make you eager to continue to the next episode. And there are some unexpected names among the voice actors…\n\nPlease immerse yourself in the world of Mystery Walk to the fullest!"},{"t":"Paws and Clean","p":["PlayStation 5"],"g":"Simulator","l":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paws_and_Clean","i":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/cobqv9.jpg","s":"In Paws & Clean, you control a mischievous cat riding on a robotic vacuum as it zooms through the hallways of a busy school. Your mission is to collect sparkling gems scattered throughout the corridors."},{"t":"Peglin","p":["Windows","macOS","Nintendo Switch"],"d":"Red Nexus Games","u":"Red Nexus Games, BlitWorks Games","g":"Roguelike, RPG","r":"August 27","l":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peglin","i":"https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co4oot.jpg","s":"Peglin is a Pachinko Roguelike - Fight enemies by collecting special orbs and popping pegs to deal damage. Acquire special relics that radically change the game and ensure no two runs are the same. Aim carefully to survive in this unique turn-based RPG!"},{"t":"Penny Blood : Hellbound","p":["Windows"],"d":"Natsume Atari , Studio Wildrose","u":"Natsume Atari","g":"Roguelike, Hack and slash","r":"December 17","l":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penny_Blood"},{"t":"Penny's Big Breakaway","p":["Windows","Nintendo Switch","PlayStation 5","Xbox Seri